      "side": 1,
      "message": "Upon further investigation, the only systems that seemed to improve with this change (because they weren\u0027t using a clear load op) are the same systems that have an optimization in ganesh to disable using clear loads in favor of discard + draw.\n\nI will revert this CL and port the optimization/policy over to graphite as well.",
